  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758586,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 Racing: Sony PlayStation - Synopsis\n\nStep into the iconic shoes of James Bond in *007 Racing* for PlayStation! Q-Branch has equipped your favorite vehicles – the Aston Martin DB5, Lotus Esprit, and BMW – with cutting-edge gadgets and firepower, ready for a thrilling mission to save the world.\n\nA sinister plot unfolds as a European diplomat and businessman conspires to hijack a shipment of NATO weapons, intending to arm international terrorists. As 007, you must race against time, navigating diverse locations from New York City to the Baltic Sea, thwarting the villain’s schemes and rescuing the captivating Cherise Litte.\n\nExperience a blend of high-octane racing and action-packed missions. Utilize smoke screens, stinger missiles, and other ingenious gadgets to outmaneuver dangerous assailants attacking from the air, sea, and ground. Engage in a solo campaign or challenge a friend in exhilarating 2-player action. Prepare for a pulse-pounding adventure where skill and gadgetry are your greatest allies. The fate of the free world rests in your hands – 007, your mission awaits!"
    },
